          "paragraphs": [
            "A 26 oz melton wool coat that comes to the knee, with a storm collar you can turn up to your ears and a half-belt at the back. Lined in cotton flannel. It's the coat for a cold platform, a cold field, or a long walk when the wind is up and there's no hurry.",
            "It's not a coat for moving fast. At nearly 3 kg it's the heaviest thing either of us makes, and it'll take a light rain but not a real one. For that, you want something from Ballard."
          ],
